@Sushanth012 nice catch, thanks! 👍

Appreciate that you guarded the condition instead of wrapping it in try/except. And you added a regression test without being asked. Not everyone does that.

Same bug is in the graph report, `report.py:186`. Wrote it up in #3044 if you want another one. 🚀

@ashvinctrl great catch, thanks! 🚀

Appreciate that you went for the root cause instead of patching around it. And you showed the Cookie header the site actually got, before and after. I checked.

If you feel like doing another, the `help wanted` label is where these turn up. 🙌

@juliosuas thanks, clean fix. 👍

Appreciate that you changed it in both places and not just the line I quoted. And you covered the redirect case with tests at both levels. I checked.

If you feel like doing another, subtask 1 of #2668 is the cookies one and it's small. 🚀
